# Routine "Weekly cut queue": the template does not carry a machine-readable schedule
# (Grok Bot sets it when the routine is created/enabled).
# Cadence described in the template: Run once a week on the day and at the hour the user picked, in the timezone saved in memory. Compute the cron from that timezone and never assume Pacific or UTC. Read the cut queue and the cut log before anything else. For every job with complete direction, do the work: cut it, caption it if captio…
# Fill in the five cron fields, then add to crontab -e:
# M H DOM MON DOW cd /path/to/best-video-editor && pi -p "/weekly-cut-queue"
